<title>FRANCE: Fives-Lille sells compressors unit.</title>
<headline>Fives-Lille sells compressors unit.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Industrial group Fives-Lille said on Tuesday it plans to sell its entire 97.50 percent stake in compressor unit Thome-Crepelle to Atlas Copco France Holding SA, a unit of Swedish group Atlas Copco for an undisclosed amount.</p>
<p>In a statement Fives-Lille said the sale, if finalised, will lead to a &quot;significant capital gain&quot; in its 1997 accounts.</p>
<p>Fives-Lille said it expected to reach a firm selling agreement before the end of the first half.</p>
<p>Thome-Crepelle is based in the northern city of Lille and had sales of 196 million francs in 1996.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
